This project is built on DJI's Mobile SDK for Android V5 (Sample Code) and
depends on the proprietary DJI Mobile SDK V5 (com.dji:dji-sdk-v5-aircraft and
its companion artifacts), which is NOT covered by this license and is subject
to DJI's own SDK license terms (https://developer.dji.com). This repository
does not bundle DJI's SDK binary; it is resolved as a build-time Maven
dependency.

DJI releases the Sample Code itself under MIT License (Copyright (c) 2019 DJI);
that original notice is preserved, per its terms, in LICENSE-DJI-SAMPLE.

This project also vendors the RTSP client from
rtmp-rtsp-stream-client-java (Copyright (c) pedroSG94), which is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0. Its notice is preserved, per that license's terms, in
app/src/main/java/com/pedro/rtsp/NOTICE.txt.

